%N A086642 Maximal number of zeros in a column of the character table of the symmetric group S_n.
%C A086642 The conjecture has been computationally verified for 3 <= n <= 200. Every column of the character table of S_n was certified to contain at least n-1 nonzero entries, while the column corresponding to cycle type (n-1,1) has exactly n-1 nonzero entries. - _Vladeta Jovovic_, Oct 17 2026
%F A086642 Conjecture: a(n) = A000041(n)-n+1, n>2. - _Vladeta Jovovic_, Jul 28 2003
%Y A086642 Cf. A085800.
